fft-power-saving-verification
Copyright 2026 Oleksandr Pylypenko

This product contains an independent computational verification of the local
Fourier compiler described in the preprint "An explicit power saving for the
exact discrete Fourier transform" (github.com/openai/math): code, tests, raw
logs, aggregated data, figures and the manuscript describing the results.

The preprint itself and its Lean formalization are NOT included in this
repository. They belong to their authors and are distributed by them under
their own terms. This repository only references them by repository, commit
and file hashes (see release/ENVIRONMENT.txt, release/lean/ and the
manuscript), and release/lean/ contains only build configuration, pins and
logs needed to recompile the formalization from its own source.
